{
  "schema_version": "arckit-capability/v1",
  "id": "arckit-tech",
  "kind": "result_fact_source",
  "runtime_role": ["fact_source_maintenance"],
  "binding_targets": ["agent"],
  "summary": "维护稳定的技术方案、架构边界、数据模型和 API 契约。",
  "input_facts": [
    "relevant_technical_facts",
    "implementation_evidence",
    "validated_constraint",
    "dynamic_case_gap"
  ],
  "outputs": [
    "tech_update",
    "tech_audit",
    "technical_contract",
    "fact_result"
  ],
  "allowed_write_targets": [
    "arckit/tech/**"
  ],
  "forbidden_decisions": [
    "unconfirmed_tradeoff_as_fact",
    "product_requirement_final",
    "release_authorization"
  ],
  "runtime_notes": [
    "智能体仅在当前动态缺口需要技术事实时调用托管案例（`managed-case`）模式；技能返回有证据支持的 `fact_result`，独立（`standalone`）模式仍可使用。",
    "仅用于稳定技术事实；未解决的权衡保留在活跃 `Case` 中，绝不声称 `Case` 已解决。"
  ]
}
